---
/**
 * Override of Starlight's `ContentPanel`.
 *
 * Starlight puts a divider and a full 1.5rem of padding between the title
 * panel and the body panel, which opens a large gap under the heading. Here
 * the divider is dropped and the panel holding the `h1` gets a short bottom
 * padding, so the intro paragraph sits directly beneath the title.
 */
---

<div
	class="content-panel px-(--sl-content-pad-x) py-6 has-[h1]:pt-[2.625rem] has-[h1]:pb-2 [&+.content-panel]:pt-0"
>
	{/* Left-aligned, not centred: the prose sits a fixed gutter from the
	    sidebar rather than floating in the middle of the pane. */}
	<div class="me-auto max-w-(--sl-content-width) [&>*+*]:mt-6">
		<slot />
	</div>
</div>
